{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "嘿，就是你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "大聪明！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "你想出去吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "那就帮我找找钥匙吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "可恶，钥匙不在这儿！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "这里是空的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "根本什么都没有！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "我还以为你会再矮一点呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "结果你长得这么高！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "就像姐姐一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "呃…姐姐？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "对，姐姐。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "难道你没见过她吗！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "见过？岂止见过。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "你是笨蛋吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "呃…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "看来真的是个笨蛋…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "来吧，快帮我找找钥匙！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "把这些铁丢进管子里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "谢谢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "现在把木柴拿下来给我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "谢谢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "帮我一下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "完成了！你瞧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "看，多漂亮啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "来，按下它！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "准备完成！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "这就行了，拿着吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "钥匙是你的了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "我是袖珍米塔.fbx！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "我有超多台词，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "最简单的建模，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "还有最漂亮的头发！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "大笨蛋先生，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "你问愚蠢问题的样子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "真可爱。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "虽然，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "这是我第一次见到你哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "不过…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "如果有人敢盗用我美妙的形象，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "我会狠狠地谴责他！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "你还不明白吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "这里是一个检查点！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "检查你智力的地方"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "过去吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "我专门护送迷路的笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "你有什么特殊之处，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "为什么不帮你呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "真傻，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "都不知道你从哪里钻出来的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "你不应该在这儿，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "所以我才要帮你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "再见了，大笨蛋！"}
